  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">The Belgian Photonovel, 1954-1985 (2023), published by Leuven University Press, has been cited 1 time. Beyond that, it has been downloaded 744 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">The Belgian Photonovel, 1954-1985 by Clarissa Colangelo was published by Leuven University Press in 2023. Conceptually, the work connects to Comics, Mainstream, Narrative, Movie theater and Literature.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 1 citation. Notable citing venues include Contemporary French and Francophone Studies. The citing authors are based in Belgium.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 744 times via OAPEN. Its subject matter aligns with Gender equality among the Sustainable Development Goals. The work was funded by KU Leuven.</p>",
